 For HunyuanVideo SFT, this flag takes the native checkpoint file.
 
+For a SAGE-GRPO numerical diagnostic, use `T09.sage-grpo --run --capture-first-policy`.
+The first warmup update writes its realized trajectory and
+`first-policy-update.json` inside the run directory. Keep the trajectory in
+experiment storage. The diagnostic run is ineligible for formal performance.
+
 The launcher checks the recipe's card count and uses `gencuda --accelerator hip`
 from this checkout. The runtime manifest records the reported platform and
 version. A wrong platform or visible card count fails before training.
